SUMMARY:Highland Market Series: Fall/Back to School
DESCRIPTION:Craft beer and craft goods—can it get any better than that?🤭 \nJoin us Sunday\, August 16\, for an afternoon celebrating back to school season and Asheville’s vibrant creative community! ✨ \nOur Event Center and Barrel Room with be brimming with a curated selection of local vendors\, artisans\, makers\, and upcyclers\, all showcasing handcrafted goods\, unique art\, and one‑of‑a‑kind finds. This event is free to attend and family‑friendly. \nShop local\, sip local\, support local 🍻
