UID:10029487-1786888800-1786899600@highlandbrewing.com
SUMMARY:EQ Trio
DESCRIPTION:BIO:\nGuitarist Eli Kahn is a performer\, composer\, & improviser from South Bend\, IN\, now living in Asheville\, NC. After graduating from Indiana University of South Bend in 2010 with degrees in both classical guitar performance & music theory\, he transitioned into jazz/fusion & improvisatory music.  \nBassist Quinn Sternberg is a new resident of Asheville\, NC after spending seven years working as a full time musician in New Orleans. He plays both electric and acoustic bass in a wide variety of ensembles and styles – versatility has made him an asset in collaborations with countless artists as a studio\, touring\, and free-lance bassist. Quinn’s musical approach relies upon providing functional and supportive bass lines\, while still generating intense live energy and creative interaction.  \nDrummer Joe Enright studied jazz at the Frost School of Music. He is heavily influenced by early 2000s neo-soul\, hip-hop\, and sample-based electronic music. He brings an improvisational approach to blending these influences into whatever musical situation he finds himself in.
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/eq-trio/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/EQ-680x41096-1-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
