SUMMARY:Meschiya Lake and the Moodswingers
DESCRIPTION:Bio\nMeschiya Lake & The Mood Swingers bring a sound rooted in vintage jazz\, swing\, and blues\, with a voice that feels like it’s been living in these songs for decades. It’s lively\, a little sultry\, and built for a room that knows how to have a good time. \nExpect toe-tapping rhythms\, playful energy\, and moments that pull the whole crowd in. The kind of night where the line between stage and audience starts to blur in the best way. \nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises. \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/meschiya-lake-and-the-paradigm-shifters/
