SUMMARY:Ska City
DESCRIPTION:Bio\nHailing from both England and the United States\, this high-energy nine-piece ska band brings the infectious rhythms of over six decades of ska music to life\, blending the best of rocksteady\, dancehall\, two-tone\, third-wave ska\, and punk. Based in Asheville\, North Carolina\, the band infuses each performance with a passion and authenticity that honors the genre’s rich history while keeping the dancefloor moving with fresh\, dynamic sounds. From the laid-back grooves of rocksteady to the sharp\, punchy energy of 3rd wave ska\, Ska City offers something for all ska lovers\, spreading their love for ska across the southeastern United States. With their infectious energy\, tight instrumentation\, killer horn section\, and love for the genre\, this band is a must-see for anyone who loves the ever-evolving world of ska music. \nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises. \n 
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/ska-city/
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/Ska-City-Resize.png
END:VEVENT
