SUMMARY:PGA Week: Play Through The Mountains at Highland
DESCRIPTION:Asheville is teeing up for a historic week as the PGA TOUR returns to Western North Carolina for the first time since 1942 at the Jack Nicklaus-designed Cliffs at Walnut Cove. Throughout tournament weekend\, swing by Highland Brewing as part of Play Through the Mountains\, a countywide initiative celebrating the neighborhoods\, small businesses\, and local experiences that make Buncombe County special. \n\n\nAt Highland Brewing\, we’re bringing the golf spirit to the Meadow and Taproom with:\nBar specials: \n\n$6 20oz Pilsners\nArnold Palmers & Transfusions\n\n\nThe Biltmore Championship Asheville tournament broadcast in the Taproom\nDiscounted brewery tours throughout tournament weekend for visitors looking to experience Asheville’s first brewery (use code GOLF to book)\nBucket Golf and Mini Golf in the Meadow\n\nWhether you’re following the tournament action or exploring Asheville between rounds\, make Highland a stop on your Play Through the Mountains adventure. Cheers to golf\, great beer\, and supporting local. 🍻⛳️
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/play-through-the-mountains/
LOCATION:Taproom At Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Public Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/OBrien_DJI_221017_0069-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
